-- Fractions in lowest terms over the integers: every quotient p/q with
-- q ≠ 0 is a coprime quotient, and a denominator coprime to p that divides
-- p³ is a unit.
-- Part of the Constructible blueprint.
-- Planned home: NumberTheory/ReducedFraction.
